    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this exceptional, brand-new two-bedroom apartment boasting one of the finest views in central Dublin, with a superb south-facing aspect overlooking the River Liffey. Flooded with natural light throughout the day, this impressive first-floor apartment has been finished to an exceptional standard, with premium fixtures and fittings throughout.\r\n\r\nFurther highlights include gas-fired underfloor heating, a large planted terrace enjoying the fantastic river outlook, a separate study area and a designated parking space. Ideally positioned in the heart of Dublin Docklands, the apartment has the Luas on the doorstep and an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities within walking distance. Available to rent immediately.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a bright open-plan living/kitchen/dining area with sliding doors opening onto the terrace, a separate study area, two bedrooms, main bathroom and en-suite.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nIdeally situated in the heart of Dublin's financial district, the apartment is surrounded by a range of bars, bistros, cafés, restaurants, hotels and the National College of Ireland. The iconic Samuel Beckett Bridge provides easy access to Grand Canal Dock and all the amenities it has to offer. The Mayor Square Luas stop is located at the entrance to the development, providing convenient access to the city centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "rand-new apartment finished to an exceptional standard.\r\nAvailable to rent immediately.\r\nOutstanding views over the River Liffey and Dublin city.\r\nSuperb south-facing aspect providing excellent natural light throughout the day.\r\nLarge planted terrace.\r\nPremium fixtures and fittings throughout.\r\nTwo generous bedrooms.\r\nSeparate study area, ideal for working from home.\r\nBright open-plan living/kitchen/dining area.\r\nGas-fired underfloor heating.\r\nDesignated parking space.\r\nLuas on the doorstep.\r\nPrime Dublin Docklands location.\r\nExcellent range of cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities within walking distance."
      },
      {
